WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Hey — if you wanna live your best creative life, we gotta talk.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
Because the artist within can only emerge if we strip away the armor.

00:09.500 --> 00:14.500
The protection you built to stay safe. That's what we're doing here. Together.

00:14.500 --> 00:19.000
If you are someone who wakes up with a weight already in your chest...

00:19.000 --> 00:23.500
If you feel anxiety. If you feel things deeply. If you're a sensitive person.

00:23.500 --> 00:29.000
You try to create, you work — but nothing seems to scratch the itch that really fulfills you.

00:29.000 --> 00:35.000
You feel like there's a gap between what you imagine to create and what actually gets created.

00:35.000 --> 00:38.500
And that gap is too big.

00:38.500 --> 00:44.000
You know deep down that you're a butterfly. You've got all this potential.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
But everyone around you — including yourself — still sees a caterpillar.

00:49.000 --> 00:53.500
And that's frustrating.

00:53.500 --> 01:00.000
You feel like your sensitivity is proof that you're not enough. That you're weak. That you're different.

01:00.000 --> 01:04.500
That you can't do ordinary things without falling apart.

01:04.500 --> 01:07.000
This is me.

01:07.000 --> 01:12.000
I've always been sensitive. I've always been scared.

01:12.000 --> 01:17.500
And the moment everything changed for me was when I stopped running away from that.

01:17.500 --> 01:24.000
I did my first public speaking event in front of 15 of my closest friends.

01:24.000 --> 01:31.000
And what I realized there — along with everyone in the room — is that we are all artists.

01:31.000 --> 01:36.000
And our shadows are actually here to help us express that art. And that's beautiful.

01:36.000 --> 01:43.000
My sensitivity, my anxiety, the feelings that I feel — were the gifts I hadn't learned to use yet.

01:43.000 --> 01:49.000
So your sensitivity is not a wound. It is not a weakness.

01:49.000 --> 01:54.000
It is a gift that allows your art to carry depth and meaning.

01:54.000 --> 02:00.000
If you think of a butterfly — the butterfly is a caterpillar for a very long time.

02:00.000 --> 02:06.000
But at a certain point, it realizes it needs to go through a metamorphosis.

02:06.000 --> 02:11.500
So it does. It spreads its wings. And now it can fly. Now it is airborne.

02:11.500 --> 02:15.000
But there's a process to do that.

02:15.000 --> 02:20.500
So just imagine it — you don't wake up with anxiety anymore. The weight is gone.

02:20.500 --> 02:27.000
You wake up feeling excited, like the day has pure potential, pure possibility for what could be created.

02:27.000 --> 02:31.000
What kind of magical things can we create today? That's what the creative life is.

02:31.000 --> 02:37.000
You feel proud of what you're creating. You feel it means so much to you.

02:37.000 --> 02:43.000
It's not just something you make — it is a true, authentic expression of who you are.

02:43.000 --> 02:49.000
Your sensitivity is not a weakness anymore. It's the gift you carry.

02:49.000 --> 02:55.000
The sensitive antenna that allows you to make great art. It's what makes your work extraordinary.

02:55.000 --> 03:01.000
Not only that — you're impacting people in ways that even surprise you.

03:01.000 --> 03:07.000
People genuinely love you for it. Because it heals them. And all you did was express your truth.

03:07.000 --> 03:13.000
You're embodying the inner artist you always knew was in there — the highest version of yourself.

03:13.000 --> 03:18.000
You feel proud, right now, in your own skin. And it feels like coming home.

03:18.000 --> 03:22.000
So — how do we do this?

03:22.000 --> 03:27.000
We start with the nervous system and the self-image.

03:27.000 --> 03:33.000
We look at what triggers your nervous system, and we learn to regulate it.

03:33.000 --> 03:39.000
We train your body to feel safe. And when we feel safe, our intelligence can have fun.

03:39.000 --> 03:43.000
That's what creativity is.

03:43.000 --> 03:50.000
Then we completely change how we see ourselves — by requalifying the thoughts reinforcing the caterpillar.

03:50.000 --> 03:57.000
We improve the meaning behind our shadows. Because sensitivity actually represents your gifts of creativity and authenticity.

03:57.000 --> 04:03.000
We get you to see yourself no longer as the caterpillar — but as the butterfly you are becoming in real time.

04:03.000 --> 04:09.000
If you can take away anything from listening to my voice right now — it's that you need permission and honesty.

04:09.000 --> 04:15.000
A pure permission in your body to go this path. To live this type of lifestyle.

04:15.000 --> 04:21.000
And the honesty to finally see yourself — and how much love you have for creativity.

04:21.000 --> 04:27.000
This is what fuels the artist. This is how you access your creative fire and go through the metamorphosis.

04:27.000 --> 04:33.000
If any part of you felt like I was talking to you — it's because I really am talking to an older version of me.

04:33.000 --> 04:37.000
I am you, in a way. Which is so cool.

04:37.000 --> 04:42.000
I see you. I know what you're carrying. And I want you to know there is a plan.

04:42.000 --> 04:46.000
You don't have to figure all of this out alone.

04:46.000 --> 04:52.000
So here's what I want you to do: scroll down, leave me your name and email,

04:52.000 --> 04:57.000
and send me a voice note back answering the two questions below.

04:57.000 --> 05:03.000
Just speak from the heart. Tell me what living your best creative life actually looks like.

05:03.000 --> 05:07.500
And tell me what's been stopping you from doing that.

05:07.500 --> 05:13.000
As soon as I get your message, I'm going to respond. That's my promise to you.

05:13.000 --> 05:19.000
And I just want to say — thank you. Cheers to beginning this creative life.

05:19.000 --> 05:25.000
This is what fuels me. So the fact that I get to help you with this too — man, this is a gift.

05:25.000 --> 05:30.000
Anyway, thank you for listening. We'll be in touch soon.
